      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This isn't correct-- if you choose \"Build and Test\" for an avatar, the asset isn't uploaded to VRChat's servers. There's no way that another user could view that avatar. Instead, other users will see you in whatever avatar you were wearing before you swapped to the local test avatar, which can have some weird (but not harmful) effects.\nAre you sure you weren't in an older version of the avatar you were testing?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
